  "rationale": "These scenarios add previously untested partitions: retrying the same key after an insufficient-stock failure, retrying after unrelated stock changes, release lookup strictness for tenant/key case variants, post-release idempotent replay with exact payload binding, validation of wrong-type op plus empty/null/boundary numeric shapes, and ignoring extra fields without altering reservation or release accounting. They also include stock observations after errors and after repeated release to catch silent state changes.",
